# LibCI Dockerfiles

This directory is a collection of dockerfiles that can be used when developing 
and testing LibCI.

The current list is supports:

- Ubuntu 16.04
- Ubuntu 14.04

## Example Usage

```bash
$ docker pull ubuntu
$ docker build -t libci-ubuntu:16.04 -f dockerfiles/ubuntu-16.04 .
$ docker run -it libci-ubuntu:16.04 make test
```
